    "custom_html_tMTNki": {
      "type": "custom-html",
      "settings": {
        "title": "",
        "html": "<div class=\"card__section expandable-content expandable-content--expandable\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"padding: 5px; margin-top: -30px;\">\n<div class=\"rte text--pull\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Elevate Your Model Collection with Green Stuff World Paints</h3>\n<p>Welcome to the ultimate destination for hobbyists and enthusiasts in Australia seeking to enhance their model collections with unsurpassed quality and variety. Here at Hearns Hobbies, we are thrilled to present our curated selection of Green Stuff World Paints - a gold standard in model crafting and customisation. Whether you are a seasoned collector or new to the hobby, our comprehensive range is designed to cater to diverse needs and creative aspirations.</p> \n<p>Discover how Green Stuff World Paints can transform your models into masterpieces, setting your collection apart.\n</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Why Choose <a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/green-stuff-world\">Green Stuff World</a> Paints for Your Hobby Projects?</h3>\n<p>Green Stuff World Paints stand at the forefront of innovation and quality, offering hobbyists an unparalleled spectrum of colours and finishes to bring their vision to life. Each paint is crafted with the user in mind, ensuring easy application, exceptional coverage, and long-lasting durability. In this section, we delve into the features that make Green Stuff World Paints a must-have for every hobbyist's toolkit:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<b>Wide Range of Colours and Effects:</b> From vibrant hues to subtle shades and special effects, find the perfect match for any project.</li>\n<li>\n<b>Superior Quality and Consistency:</b> Experience consistent results with paints formulated for smooth application and minimal brush marks.</li>\n<li>\n<b>Versatility for Various Projects:</b> Ideal for miniature painting Warhammer Old World or 40k, military modelling, dollhouses and more, these paints adapt to your creative needs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Bringing Your Models to Life with <a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/blogs/educational/top-7-essential-modelling-tools-every-modeller-should-have\">Expert Tips and Inspiration</a>\n</h3>\n<p>Embarking on a model painting journey can be both exciting and daunting. To support your creative endeavours, we offer a treasure trove of expert tips, techniques, and inspiration. Whether you're aiming for a realistic finish on your RC boat or seeking to add intricate details to your model figures, our guidance will help you harness the potential of Green Stuff World Paints to achieve astonishing results. Explore topics including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<b>Preparation and Priming:</b>The key steps to ensure your model is paint-ready.</li>\n<li>\n<b>Advanced Painting Techniques:</b> Elevate your skills with blending, layering, and more.</li>\n<li>\n<b>Creative Inspiration and Ideas:</b> Spark your imagination with showcased projects from fellow hobbyists.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Craft Your Masterpiece with Hearns Hobbies</h3>\n<p>At Hearns Hobbies, we're not just a supplier; we're a community of passionate hobbyists dedicated to the art and craft of model collection. Our extensive selection of Green Stuff World Paints and beyond empowers you to take your hobby to the next level. Shop with us today and experience the difference quality hobby paints make in bringing your models to life.</p>\n</div>\n<button class=\"expandable-content__toggle\" style=\"padding:5px\">                             <span class=\"expandable-content__toggle-icon\"></span>                         <span class=\"expandable-content__toggle-text\" data-view-more=\"View more\" data-view-less=\"View less\">View more</span>                    </button>\n</div>"
      }
    },
